@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+# Retries
+
+Clients can retry idempotent requests on transient failures.
+
+```python
+client = httpx.Client(retries=httpx.Retry(3, backoff_factor=0.5))
+client.get("https://example.org/", extensions={"retries": 0})  # per-request override
+```
+
+Retries apply per hop. Exhausted transport errors raise `httpx.RetryError`.
